  "summary": "Ollama contains a heap out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the GGUF model loader in github.com/ollama/ollama",
  "details": "Ollama is vulnerable to a heap out-of-bounds read in its GGUF model loader. A specially crafted GGUF file can cause the loader to read beyond the allocated heap buffer, potentially leading to a denial of service (crash).",
